{"text": "The forest was full of trees, bushes, and shadows. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Stripy shadows, spotty shadows. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And patchy shadows. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Were everywhere. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The sun was shining. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Through the leaves. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In little pieces. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The animals lived there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For a long, long time. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Slowly they began to change color. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Giraffe got big blotches. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the Zebra got stripes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Other animals became darker. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Like the bark of the trees. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Now they were much harder to see. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Than before. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Meanwhile the Leopard and the hunter. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Were still on the High Veldt. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They looked everywhere. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But there was nothing to eat. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They ate rats and beetles. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And they both got stomachaches.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "f", "o", "r", "e", "s", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "f", "u", "l", "l", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "r", "e", "e", "s", ",", " ", "b", "u", "s", "h", "e", "s", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "s", "h", "a", "d", "o", "w", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "t", "r", "i", "p", "y", " ", "s", "h", "a", "d", "o", "w", "s", ",", " ", "s", "p", "o", "t", "t", "y", " ", "s", "h", "a", "d", "o", "w", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "n", "d", " ", "p", "a", "t", "c", "h", "y", " ", "s", "h", "a", "d", "o", "w", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", 